---

## Design Decisions

- **Dashboard refresh ships alone** — zero backend changes, pure `web_ui.cpp`
- **Tap-to-override uses double-tap** — no native `confirm()` dialogs, glove-friendly
- **Alerts panel is its own item** — needs backend to read safety flags and push on WS connect
- **Weather uses configurable lat/lon** — no GPS module, user sets coordinates in Config tab
- **Override timeout persisted** — survives reboots via RuntimeCache
